or OATT changes, including rates and to a lesser extent wheeling volumes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/21/idacorp-inc-ida-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"IDA 2019 Q1","e":"ida","d":"2019-05-02","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Steve Keen","x":"The increase in volume for the quarter was slightly offset by a 10% decrease in open access transmission tariff rate that became effective last October.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/idacorp-ida-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"IDA 2019 Q1","e":"ida","d":"2019-05-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Darrel Anderson","x":"I think that's one of the things as we -- with Boardman to Hemingway, we all targeted kind of pieces that we might take initially, but we'll be looking very closely at that to see if the piece we originally bought is the right size, or if it may make more sense.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/idacorp-ida-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"IDA 2019 Q2","e":"ida","d":"2019-08-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Steve Keen","x":"Transmission wheeling-related revenues were down roughly 13% or $2 million as the Open Access Transmission Tariff rates declined by about 11% last October.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/02/idacorp-ida-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"IDA 2019 Q3","e":"ida","d":"2019-10-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Steve Keen","x":"In addition, the open-access tariff rates declined by about 11% over the comparable period.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/idacorp-ida-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"IDA 2019 Q3","e":"ida","d":"2019-10-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Steve Keen","x":"The tariff rate filed with the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission declined an additional 13% effective October 1st, 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/idacorp-ida-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"IDA 2019 Q4","e":"ida","d":"2020-02-20","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Steve Keen","x":"Idaho Power's open access transmission tariff rates declined by 10% in October of 2018 and again by 13% in October 2019, lowering transmission wheeling-related revenues by $5.3 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/21/idacorp-ida-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"IDA 2020 Q1","e":"ida","d":"2020-04-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Steve Keen","x":"Next, Idaho Power's open access transmission tariff rates declined by 13% in October of 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/30/idacorp-ida-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"IDA 2020 Q1","e":"ida","d":"2020-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alex Morgan","x":"Potentially how much O&M cost savings could you factor in?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/30/idacorp-ida-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"IDA 2020 Q4","e":"ida","d":"2021-02-18","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Steven R. Keen","x":"Transmission wheeling-related revenues also decreased $2.2 million primarily due to a 13% decline in Idaho Power's open access transmission tariff rate in October of 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/idacorp-inc-ida-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"IDA 2020 Q4","e":"ida","d":"2021-02-18","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Steven R. Keen","x":"This decrease was partially offset by an increase in wheeling volumes this past summer related to warmer weather in the Southwest, U.S. and California as well as roughly 10% increase in tariff rate beginning October 1 of 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/idacorp-inc-ida-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"IDA 2021 Q1","e":"ida","d":"2021-04-29","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Steven R. Keen","x":"This was partly due to a 20% increase in wheeling volumes as well as a 10% increase in Idaho Power's open access transmission tariff rate last October to reflect higher transmission costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/idacorp-inc-ida-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"IDA 2021 Q1","e":"ida","d":"2021-04-29","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Brian J. Russo","x":"You mentioned the dynamics, obviously, the higher tariff rate, the volumes and wheeling power into the Southwest.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/idacorp-inc-ida-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"IDA 2021 Q1","e":"ida","d":"2021-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Steven R. Keen","x":"This was primarily due to the timing of cloud-seeding activities and cost-saving initiatives at our jointly owned coal plant.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/idacorp-inc-ida-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"IDA 2021 Q2","e":"ida","d":"2021-07-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Steven R. Keen","x":"In addition, wheeling customers paid 10% more for Idaho Power's open access transmission tariff rate that increased last October to reflect higher transmission costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/idacorp-inc-ida-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[35,1,4303,0,0,0,3744,320],[36,1,5688,0,0,0,4755,535],[37,1,4621,0,0,0,4235,172],[38,1,3265,0,0,0,2930,152],[39,1,4393,0,0,0,4001,173],[40,1,5572,0,0,0,4774,530],[41,1,7932,0,0,0,7030,573],[44,1,7424,0,0,0,6665,421],[45,1,5128,0,0,0,2839,1953],[46,1,8537,0,0,0,7603,424],[47,1,3933,0,0,0,3503,113],[65,1,6870,0,0,0,4395,1979],[67,1,6586,0,0,0,3933,2211]],"cinema":[[35,1,4303,0,0,0,3744,320],[36,1,5688,0,0,0,4755,535],[37,1,4621,0,0,0,4235,172],[38,1,3265,0,0,0,2930,152],[39,1,4393,0,0,0,4001,173],[40,1,5572,0,0,0,4774,530],[41,1,7932,0,0,0,7030,573],[44,1,7424,0,0,0,6665,421],[45,1,5128,0